The benign class includes sites drawn from the Tranco list of popular domains
(list K9YYW, https://tranco-list.eu/list/K9YYW), by Le Pochat et al.,
"Tranco: A Research-Oriented Top Sites Ranking Hardened Against
Manipulation", NDSS 2019.

Brand names that appear in the dataset belong to their owners and are used
only to describe which brand a phishing page impersonates.

This work was carried out within the AI4CTI project (FISA-2023-00168), funded
by the Italian Ministry of University and Research (MUR), FISA 2023 programme.
